  "id": "marital-conflict",
  "term": "marital conflict",
  "definition": "Marital conflict is disagreement or dispute between spouses about issues in family life, including both emotional and physical forms of conflict. In psychology, it is commonly treated as an indicator of family functioning and the overall quality of family life.",
